    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. If a vector&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;satisfies&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
