  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have been given that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8757;</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8800;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>324</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>413</mn></math></p><p>Hence, this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
